  "body": "<p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"easy-heading-free\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001\" /></p><p><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id=\"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002\" ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"numberedheadings\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003\"><ac:rich-text-body><h1>Basic Info</h1><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup><col /><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th>Service Name</th><td>service-a</td></tr><tr><th>Owner</th><td><ac:link><ri:user ri:userkey=\"0000000000000000000000000000000a\" /></ac:link></td></tr><tr><th>Console</th><td><a href=\"https://console.example.com/service-a\">service-a console</a></td></tr></tbody></table><h1>Operations</h1><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup><col /><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th>Logs</th><td><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id=\"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004\" ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">bash</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[example-cli service enter service-a-<module>-<env>-xx\ntail -f log/data.log]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></div></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\">Regions</th></tr><tr><td>Region A</td><td>Region B</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Notes</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>How to check the cache:</p><ul><li><ac:inline-comment-marker ac:ref=\"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006\">open the <a href=\"https://console.example.com/cache\">cache console</a></ac:inline-comment-marker></li></ul></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2>Architecture</h2><p><ac:image ac:width=\"860\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"service a architecture.drawio.png\" /></ac:image></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"expand\" ac:schema-version=\"1